{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. Survive the nights, survey further into the unknown and track down the source of these rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Towers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tower upgrades from a market that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.mp4?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover alien Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful artifacts to augment your defense. Finding the right combinations can take your defenses to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different commanders, each with their own three starting towers, abilities and passive. Each offers their own play style and strategy. Master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.mp4?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your defense in Endless Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 25 nights and enter Endless mode, testing the limits of your defenses!\u00a0 </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defense Grid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/6d3da81e723098434b4555cfff9760c5b6acc47a.jpg"},{"name":"Defense Network","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/39e24f19d88d7801870ad8fe4504084aa42377a1.jpg"},{"name":"Defense Matrix","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/1c5548f81eb7cdb6e64b16d51a102f0e1e820c09.jpg"},{"name":"Roadblock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/ae3cdf86fec6f30093b6139359e2c347fb3184f4.jpg"},{"name":"Haymaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/0542a4cf5c1750f2563fc5626e21c0a7c73ac3c2.jpg"},{"name":"Cold Snap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/4bada0fed720e9d08299bca229344dcf6b6965d5.jpg"},{"name":"Flashfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/232f987fab7b854683e28d382b5f992233e30991.jpg"},{"name":"Alpha Decay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/2d3dcbf8bf6a20116d3192002b5e3b1513a74410.jpg"},{"name":"The Lance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/aee37062f6fdf8e9d548fc11bc7e8f6e54e751b5.jpg"},{"name":"Eye in the Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686580/7c0ec52489de0f763047f7c68d46849491550cb3.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686580?t=1766479470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686580?t=1766479470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/e84db426a740fb2f21de0128bef5d0b06b56175c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766479470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/e84db426a740fb2f21de0128bef5d0b06b56175c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766479470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3861580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/6e4dae23025a5df14feaa96c42786514.avif?t=1766479470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras_big/6e4dae23025a5df14feaa96c42786514.avif?t=1766479470 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. Survive the nights, survey further into the unknown and track down the source of these rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/531bbda07a582f152fa6580bb4feb811.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Towers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tower upgrades from a market that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/5ffef96de31ee499bbfa4a61b86419d5.mp4?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover alien Artifacts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful artifacts to augment your defense. Finding the right combinations can take your defenses to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/0a1390dc348d12deac6d6ad9abad6442.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different commanders, each with their own three starting towers, abilities and passive. Each offers their own play style and strategy. Master them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.poster.avif?t=1766479470\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.webm?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/64bf8ba468f574ba8f794a3477ff6313.mp4?t=1766479470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your defense in Endless Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 25 nights and enter Endless mode, testing the limits of your defenses!\u00a0 </p>","developers":["RefinedBearGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/98b3cff1e908a698ea055bc8f86632248e2fd60f/header.jpg?t=1766479470","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686580/1346475205/2b8ee9df49214969725560cb93290b781d93cc20/1762958953/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762959576","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686580/1346475205/2b